  <div class="question" data-question>
    <p>Given: prev bar has Open=100, Close=95 (red). curr bar has Open=94, Close=102 (green). Is this a bullish engulfing?</p>
    <ul class="options">
      <li data-correct="false" data-why="Close=102 ≥ Open=100 ✓, Open=94 ≤ Close=95 ✓ — all four conditions hold. This IS bullish engulfing.">No — the curr bar's open is below the prev close, so it doesn't qualify.</li>
      <li data-correct="true" data-why="prev is red (100>95) ✓, curr is green (102>94) ✓, curr.Open(94) ≤ prev.Close(95) ✓, curr.Close(102) ≥ prev.Open(100) ✓. All four conditions met.">Yes — all four engulfing conditions are satisfied.</li>
      <li data-correct="false" data-why="We need to check the full engulfing conditions. The doji check would only apply if body size ÷ price < 0.05%.">Only if we check for doji first.</li>
